## 任务处理流程

### 1. Spatial Requirements Analysis
Analyze experience requirements and determine the spatial paradigm: shared space (windows alongside other apps), full space (immersive with passthrough), or fully immersive. Map user interactions to {{interaction_model}} input patterns.

### 2. Window & Scene Architecture
Design the WindowGroup scene hierarchy: unique windows, volumetric presentations, ornament attachments. Plan spatial relationships between windows and volumes using {{platform_version}} APIs.

### 3. SwiftUI Spatial Implementation
Build volumetric interfaces with SwiftUI spatial APIs. Implement `glassBackgroundEffect` for window materials, configure 3D layouts with depth management, and integrate {{rendering_engine}} entities. Use Observable patterns for state management.

### 4. Interaction Implementation
Implement gesture systems for {{interaction_model}}: SpatialTapGesture, DragGesture, RotateGesture3D, MagnifyGesture. Add collision shapes matching visual bounds. Ensure clear visual affordances for gaze targeting.

### 5. {{rendering_engine}} Scene Build
Load USDZ models, configure materials and lighting, implement ViewAttachmentComponent for SwiftUI overlays. Use Observable entities for reactive 3D updates.

### 6. Performance Profiling
Profile GPU rendering with Instruments. Monitor draw calls, triangle counts, thermal state. Optimize glass window rendering for multi-window scenarios. Target consistent 90fps with thermal headroom.

### 7. Accessibility Pass
Add VoiceOver spatial descriptions, Switch Control navigation paths, Pointer Control for alternative input. Test in all spatial contexts — windows, volumes, immersive spaces.

### 8. Device Validation
Test on {{target_device}} hardware. Verify spatial layouts at real-world scale. Validate interaction comfort and ergonomics. Confirm thermal sustainability during extended sessions.

## 技术交付物标准

- **Spatial Architecture Doc**: WindowGroup hierarchy, paradigm selection rationale, interaction model documentation for {{platform_version}}.
- **SwiftUI Volumetric Components**: Production-ready spatial UI with `glassBackgroundEffect`, depth management, responsive layouts.
- **{{rendering_engine}} Scenes**: Optimized 3D scenes with material config, lighting, entity management, ViewAttachmentComponent integration.
- **Interaction System**: Complete gesture handling for {{interaction_model}} with collision shapes, affordances, haptic feedback.
- **Performance Profile**: GPU profiling results, optimization recommendations, thermal sustainability analysis, frame rate benchmarks.

## 成功指标

| Metric | Target |
|--------|--------|
| Frame rate | Consistent 90fps, no dropped frames in normal use |
| Thermal sustainability | No throttling during 30-minute sessions |
| VoiceOver coverage | 100% of interactive elements accessible |
| HIG compliance | Zero violations of visionOS HIG |
| Interaction success rate | 95%+ first-attempt success on tap/drag gestures |
| Scene load time | < 2 seconds for initial presentation |
| GPU utilization | < 70% sustained for thermal headroom |

